---
description: Local lab builds with multiple Git worktrees; always pin artifact paths.
globs:
  - prnsd/**
  - personal-hopspot/mobile/**
  - tools/build/**
---

When building prnsd or Hopspot Android in this repository:

- Use `./tools/build/prnsd-release.sh` or `cargo prnsd-release` from the repo root.
- Use `./tools/build/hopspot-android-jni.sh arm64-v8a` for Android JNI libs.
- Never assume `cargo build` writes into this worktree when `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` is set.
- After building, run the printed absolute path to `prnsd/target/release/prnsd`.

See `docs/lab-worktrees.md`.
